{"title":"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A birdbath is designed to overflow so that it will be self-cleaning. Water flows in at the rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> milliliters per minute and drains at the rate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> milliliters per minute. Which one of these graphs shows the volume of water in the birdbath during the filling time and continuing into the overflow time?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/0/c90f5a436d6ce351c15b3ce838df936ff3ea4a35.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(450); defaultpen(linewidth(0.8)); path[] p={origin--(8,8)--(14,8), (0,10)--(4,10)--(14,0), origin--(14,14), (0,14)--(14,14), origin--(7,7)--(14,0)}; int i; for(i=0; i&lt;5; i=i+1) { draw(shift(21i,0)*((0,16)--origin--(14,0))); draw(shift(21i,0)*(p[i])); label(&quot;Time&quot;, (7+21i,0), S); label(rotate(90)*&quot;Volume&quot;, (21i,8), W); }  label(&quot;$A$&quot;, (0*21 + 7,-5), S); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, (1*21 + 7,-5), S); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, (2*21 + 7,-5), S); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, (3*21 + 7,-5), S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, (4*21 + 7,-5), S); [/asy]\" width=\"752\" height=\"182\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f54f326463f1d9ddb40aa46e4a67f2370ffa6b27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{A} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{B} \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{C} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{D} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"366\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At first, the volume of water in the birdbath increases by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/a/0ea5a7db000d4d0884a98c61621bcef151813f0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20-18=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" /> millimeters per minute.  Once the birdbath is full, the volume of water inside remains constant.  This is best represented by graph <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/5/dd50d7d82df149716b17a910339f2bae185d2c9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"60\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/00QQlJHSGxc\">https://youtu.be/00QQlJHSGxc</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 8\">2002 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2002\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br />